OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to tackle long-term empty
OL,4,Ashops across towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour towns have been chosen to pilot a
OL,7,Fscheme to get empty shops back into
OL,8,Fuse.
OL,10,FWestmorland and Furness Council wants
OL,11,Fto trial new legislation designed to
OL,12,Ftackle high street premises that have
OL,13,Fbeen empty for a long time.
OL,15,FUnder the rules, the council would be
OL,16,Fable to auction leases for the units to
OL,17,Fbring them back into use and "support
OL,18,Fthe vitality" of town centres.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
