OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to tackle long-term empty
OL,4,Ashops across towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a meeting on Tuesday, the Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrat authority's cabinet will
OL,8,Fdiscuss a proposal to launch a pilot
OL,9,Ftargeting Barrow, Penrith, Kendal and
OL,10,FUlverston.
